    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/mika-milo/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=567233745648616357&sectionId=567241576498070569)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9xL7oQio8_text","label":"gg9xL7oQio8_text","default":"<p>Bonita Turner,&nbsp;</p><p>Editor Junior&nbsp;</p><p>Magazine</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggquqxiKDq__text","label":"ggquqxiKDq__text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:#F2EFEF;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">\"Absolutely love the vibrant colour palette, soft to the touch cotton/cashmere mix and the fact that my favourite jumpers are now machine washable!</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0jEERczIL_text","label":"gg0jEERczIL_text","default":"<p>Eleonore Crompton, Deputy Editor,&nbsp;</p><p>Junior</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMg0mbke4a_text","label":"ggMg0mbke4a_text","default":"<p>\"This is one of my favourite knitwear brands and although I always covet their cashmere, it’s great to see their designs available in a soft organic cotton and cashmere mix that’s easy to clean!\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcIn_8XsGP_text","label":"ggcIn_8XsGP_text","default":"<p><strong>Jakki Jones</strong>,</p><p>Artist&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8EE9xeeDR_text","label":"gg8EE9xeeDR_text","default":"<p>\"Really lovely collection. The boys wear really stood out, a little different with the colour pops. A stylish twist on a classic style.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFaRAhwy5N_text","label":"ggFaRAhwy5N_text","default":"<p><strong>Charlotte Kewley</strong>, Children’s stylist</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNppbgPuz-_text","label":"ggNppbgPuz-_text","default":"<p>\"Love the quality and combination of timeless &amp; modern pieces. Fascinating story behind the brand. As a fellow Scot I know a little about Scottish cashmere, loved hearing more.\"</p>"}],
